### Rust ###
# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
target/

# Cargo.lock stays version-controlled for executables: reproducible builds,
# locked dependency versions, and accurate Dependabot alerts.

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which contain debugging information
*.pdb

# End of https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/rust
